  "s_ba5425c5": "{scene}.\n\nOutput a JSON array only, each item shaped like:\n{\"title\":\"title\",\"author\":\"author\",\"progress\":a number from 0-100 or null,\"status\":\"one of unread/reading/finished or null\",\"confidence\":a number from 0-1}\n\nRequirements:\n1. Only output books that are **actually visible** in the image; don't add books you assume should be there;\n2. Ignore UI text (filters, search, sort, All, Shelf, N books, etc.);\n3. Copy titles exactly as shown, including ones cut off by an ellipsis — don't complete them yourself;\n4. Leave author as an empty string if it can't be read; don't guess;\n5. Only fill in author when it really is written in the image.\n{n}",
